# Your rule content

The firebase database structure for this app is the following:

activities
    classId
    className
    teacherName
    timestamp
    type
    userId

classes
    code
    createdAt
    name
    teacherId
    updatedAt

enrollments
    classId
    enrolledAt
    status
    studentId

quizAttempts
    classId
    correctAnswers
    questionCount
    questions [array]
        correctIndex [number]
        id
        isCorrect
        options [array]
            text
        selectedAnswer [number]
        text

quizzes
    createdAt
    id
    questions
        correctIndex
            options
                text
        text
    teacherId

users 
    bio
    classes
        array in classes includes ids of classes associated to this user
    createdAt
    email
    lastLogin
    name
    phone
    role (student or teacher)
    updatedAt